                <section class="legal-section">
                    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
                    <p>When you use EasyRent, we may collect information necessary to provide and manage your vehicle rental services.</p>

                    <h2>A. Account Information</h2>
                    <p>When you create an EasyRent account, we may collect:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Full name</li>
                        <li>Email address</li>
                        <li>Contact number</li>
                        <li>Password</li>
                        <li>Account credentials and security-related information</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>This information allows us to create and maintain your customer account and provide access to your rental records.</p>

                    <h2>B. Identification Information</h2>
                    <p>For rental verification, EasyRent may require valid identification information. Depending on the requirements of the rental transaction, this may include:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Type of valid ID</li>
                        <li>Identification details</li>
                        <li>Uploaded identification documents or images</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Identification information is used to verify the customer's identity and eligibility for the rental transaction.</p>

                    <h2>C. Rental and Booking Information</h2>
                    <p>When you search for or book a vehicle, we may collect information such as:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Selected vehicle</li>
                        <li>Passenger capacity</li>
                        <li>Pick-up date</li>
                        <li>Drop-off date</li>
                        <li>Rental details</li>
                        <li>Assigned driver information</li>
                        <li>Booking or transaction reference</li>
                        <li>Rental status</li>
                        <li>Other information necessary to process your reservation</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Because EasyRent provides driver-assisted vehicle rentals, driver information may also be associated with your rental transaction when applicable.</p>

                    <h2>D. Payment and Transaction Information</h2>
                    <p>When you make a payment or have a rental transaction with EasyRent, the system may record information such as:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Payment method</li>
                        <li>Amount paid</li>
                        <li>Payment status</li>
                        <li>Payment date</li>
                        <li>Remaining or outstanding balance</li>
                        <li>Transaction history</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>EasyRent uses this information to process and track your rental payments and account balance.</p>

                    <h2>E. Ratings and Reviews</h2>
                    <p>After completing a rental, you may voluntarily submit ratings, reviews, comments, or feedback about:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>The vehicle</li>
                        <li>Vehicle comfort, performance, and safety</li>
                        <li>The assigned driver</li>
                        <li>Professionalism</li>
                        <li>Driving</li>
                        <li>Courtesy</li>
                        <li>Your overall rental experience</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Your feedback helps EasyRent evaluate and improve its rental services.</p>

                    <h2>F. Account and Security Information</h2>
                    <p>When you use features such as My Profile, Change Password, and Security &amp; Privacy, EasyRent may process information necessary to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Update your account details</li>
                        <li>Change your password</li>
                        <li>Protect your account</li>
                        <li>Manage security settings</li>
                        <li>Maintain the security of your account</li>
                    </ul>
                
                </section>

                <section class="legal-section">
                    <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
                    <p>EasyRent uses the information collected through the client-side system for legitimate rental and service-related purposes, including:</p>

                    <h2>Rental and Booking Management</h2>
                    <p>To process vehicle searches, reservations, rental transactions, pick-up and drop-off arrangements, and driver-assisted services.</p>

                    <h2>Identity Verification</h2>
                    <p>To verify the identity and eligibility of customers before providing rental services.</p>

                    <h2>Payment Management</h2>
                    <p>To record payments, balances, transaction history, and other information necessary to manage your rental account.</p>

                    <h2>Customer Support</h2>
                    <p>To respond to questions, concerns, requests, and other communications regarding your rental.</p>

                    <h2>Service Improvement</h2>
                    <p>To evaluate customer ratings, reviews, and feedback and improve the quality of EasyRent's vehicles and services.</p>

                    <h2>Account Security</h2>
                    <p>To protect customer accounts, prevent unauthorized access, and maintain the security of the EasyRent system.</p>

                    <h2>Legal and Operational Requirements</h2>
                    <p>To maintain records and comply with applicable legal, regulatory, and legitimate business requirements.</p>
                
                </section>

                <section class="legal-section">
                    <h2>Information We Do Not Collect Unnecessarily</h2>
                    <p>EasyRent follows the principle of collecting only information that is reasonably necessary for providing its vehicle rental services.</p>
                    <p>Information provided through the system should only be used for its intended rental, account, payment, verification, security, or service-improvement purpose.</p>
                
                </section>

                <section class="legal-section">
                    <h2>How We Protect Your Information</h2>
                    <p>EasyRent takes reasonable measures to protect customer information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or misuse.</p>
                    <p>These measures may include:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Account authentication</li>
                        <li>Password protection</li>
                        <li>Access controls</li>
                        <li>Restricted access to customer information</li>
                        <li>Secure handling of identification and rental information</li>
                        <li>Security monitoring and maintenance of the system</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Customers are also responsible for keeping their account credentials confidential and should not share their password with other individuals.</p>
                
                </section>

                <section class="legal-section">
                    <h2>Sharing of Information</h2>
                    <p>EasyRent does not disclose customer information unnecessarily. Personal information may only be accessed or disclosed when reasonably necessary to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Process and fulfill a rental transaction</li>
                        <li>Verify a customer's identity</li>
                        <li>Provide the requested rental service</li>
                        <li>Process or record a payment</li>
                        <li>Provide customer support</li>
                        <li>Maintain system security</li>
                        <li>Comply with applicable laws or lawful requests</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Where information must be shared with a service provider or authorized party to perform a necessary service, EasyRent should limit the information shared to what is reasonably required for that purpose.</p>
                
                </section>

                <section class="legal-section">
                    <h2>Your Account and Personal Information</h2>
                    <p>As an EasyRent customer, you may access and update certain information associated with your account through Account Settings.</p>
                    <p>The available account features may include:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>My Profile</strong> – review and update personal information</li>
                        <li><strong>Saved Vehicle</strong> – view preferred vehicle to rent.</li>
                        <li><strong>Change Password</strong> – change your account password</li>
                        <li><strong>Security &amp; Privacy</strong> – manage available account security settings</li>
                        <li><strong>Transactions &amp; Rentals</strong> – view rental activity and history</li>
                        <li><strong>Payments &amp; Balance</strong> – view payment and balance information</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>If you believe that information associated with your account is incorrect, you may contact EasyRent for assistance.</p>
                
                </section>

                <section class="legal-section">
                    <h2>Retention of Information</h2>
                    <p>EasyRent may retain customer information for as long as reasonably necessary to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Complete and document rental transactions</li>
                        <li>Maintain customer account records</li>
                        <li>Track payment and rental history</li>
                        <li>Resolve disputes or customer concerns</li>
                        <li>Maintain system security</li>
                        <li>Fulfill legitimate business or legal requirements</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>When information is no longer reasonably required, it should be securely deleted, disposed of, or anonymized in accordance with applicable requirements and EasyRent's retention practices.</p>
                
                </section>

                <section class="legal-section">
                    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
                    <p>EasyRent's vehicle rental services are intended for individuals who are legally eligible to enter into a rental transaction.</p>
                    <p>EasyRent does not knowingly request or collect personal information from children for the purpose of independently creating rental accounts or completing rental transactions.</p>
                
                </section>

                <section class="legal-section">
                    <h2>Data Privacy Rights</h2>
                    <p>Subject to applicable laws and regulations, customers may have rights regarding their personal information, including the right to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Know what personal information is being collected and processed</li>
                        <li>Request access to their personal information</li>
                        <li>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information</li>
                        <li>Request deletion or disposal where legally applicable</li>
                        <li>Object to certain forms of processing where legally applicable</li>
                        <li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent</li>
                        <li>Raise a concern regarding the handling of their personal information</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Requests may be submitted through EasyRent's available customer support channels.</p>
                
                </section>

                <section class="legal-section">
                    <h2>Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
                    <p>EasyRent may update this Privacy Policy when necessary to reflect changes to the system, rental services, legal requirements, or data-processing practices.</p>
                    <p>When significant changes are made, the updated policy should be made available through the EasyRent website.</p>
                    <p>The Effective Date at the beginning of this policy indicates when the current version took effect.</p>
                
                </section>


